WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.050
Thank you very much,
members of the Academy.

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:03.870
First, I have to
thank my father.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:04.770
And my father.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:05.730
This is for my father.

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.980
Thank you to my dad for
everything he taught me.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:08.520
To you, Dad.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.190
You taught me what
it means to be a man.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:13.750
You know, my dad didn't get
to see me do any of this,

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:16.260
but I think he's looking
down on me right now.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:19.950
I want to thank my
father up there,

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:23.170
the man who, when I said I
wanted to be an actor, he said,

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:23.670
wonderful.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:27.060
Just have a backup
profession like welding.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.247
All those days of listening
to Sly and the Family Stone

00:00:30.247 --> 00:00:31.830
and Marvin Gaye,
they really paid off.

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:33.160
So thank you, Dad.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.890
Dad.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:37.980
[LAUGHS] [SNIFFS]
Well, you know.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:42.060
And especially to my
father, I love you

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.040
more than anything in the world.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:47.070
When you give me this award, you
honor my father, Paul Sorvino,

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:50.240
who has taught me everything
I know about acting.

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.648
I want to thank my
daughter, for telling me

00:00:52.648 --> 00:00:54.690
just before I got up here,
if you don't win, Dad,

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:55.950
you're still good.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:58.700
[LAUGHTER]

